_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-miAKt5zEl0laq-vuIYrcEdRFWjVJFMTmdRBeDio-QA&oe=6B030F5F"}, "display_name": "Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer", "keywords": ["Gang", "Survival", "Cooking", "Fight", "Gun"], "long_description": "\n Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer is the laugh-out-loud VR adventure where you and your friends (up to 4 players \u2013 insert player count) team up to flip your fortunes.\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n{1105387631512705}\n\n\n Grow exotic herbs, cook up amazing (and maybe bizarre) dishes, take down any troublemakers who get in your way, and hustle your way from zero to hero.\n{1401990557573965}\n Earn serious cash, upgrade your gear, and show everyone who's truly running things! All in immersive Meta Quest VR.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n\ud83e\udd1d SQUAD GOALS! HILARIOUS CO-OP MULTIPLAYER\n\n\u2694\ufe0f PAYBACK TIME! TAKE DOWN THOSE ANNOYING FOES\n\n\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf72 FROM HERB GARDEN TO GOURMET (OR NOT)! GROW, COOK, PROFIT!!!\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 RISE FROM RAGS TO RICHES! EARN BIG & LIVE LARGE\n\n   \n\nREADY TO STIR UP SOME TROUBLE (AND GET PAID FOR IT)?\n\nJump into Street Simulator Z: Multiplayer, call your squad, and start your wild journey from nobody to a notorious (and wealthy) legend!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Life in this town can be a drag, especially with all these annoying jerks causing trouble! "}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support